  "description": "Performance Video Control Center: one desk for RS6, E2, PixelHue, ATEM, Panasonic PTZ, Pixera and Millumin, with SCOPES (Desktop Video ingest), Path C Stream Deck pages, and TSL tally on the ATEM page.",
